            "review_title": "Review at Cơm Niêu Việt",
            "review_text": "Curious48060564992\nHanoi, Vietnam26 contributions\n0\nFood reviews\nMar 2024 • Business\nThank you Com Nieu Viet for bringing us a delicious dinner. I usually don't like going out to eat, so ordering food to be delivered to my door like this is very convenient. The meals are carefully packaged and clean, the sauce and crab soup are very delicious, suitable for people who like to eat Vietnamese food like my family.\nWritten March 11, 2024",
